  "description": "AbpConnections: connections to outside systems for an ABP app on .NET 10 and EF Core. Kinds with their settings and secrets (encrypted with Data Protection, never shown again), OAuth 2.0 sign-in with PKCE once for everyone or by each person with their own account, tokens refreshed one at a time on any server, a test call, the security audit; and the outbound guard: no private or loopback address unless the operator allows it, only the hosts the site allows.",
